    "China takes around two per cent of Kenya's tea exports today\n(<a href=\"https://www.teaboard.or.ke/images/downloads/performance-highlights/TEA-INDUSTRY-PERFORMANCE-REPORT-2025.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Tea Board of Kenya, 2025</a>).\nAny organisation whose business grows as that figure grows has a reason to be\nvisible here.": "目前中国约占肯尼亚茶叶出口的2%(<a href=\"https://www.teaboard.or.ke/images/downloads/performance-highlights/TEA-INDUSTRY-PERFORMANCE-REPORT-2025.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">肯尼亚茶叶局,2025年</a>)。任何业务随该数字增长而增长的组织都有理由在此展示其存在。",
