    "What partnership gives you": "合作伙伴身份为您带来的价值",
    "<strong>Strategic relevance.</strong> Partnership connects your organisation to the Kenya-China tea trade at the level where trade, investment and policy decisions are made.": "<strong>战略相关性。</strong>合作伙伴身份将您的组织与肯尼亚-中国茶叶贸易联系起来,直达贸易、投资和政策决策层面。",
    "<strong>Audience access.</strong> Meet tea industry leaders, government officials, investors, exporters, importers, researchers and technology providers in one place.": "<strong>受众接触。</strong>在同一场合会见茶产业领袖、政府官员、投资者、出口商、进口商、研究人员和技术提供商。",
    "<strong>Category leadership.</strong> Be identified with a specific part of the industry: production, processing, technology, finance or logistics.": "<strong>品类领导地位。</strong>与产业的特定领域建立关联:生产、加工、技术、金融或物流。",
    "<strong>Visibility.</strong> Appear across summit communications, on-site branding and event materials.": "<strong>曝光度。</strong>在峰会传播、现场品牌展示和活动材料中获得露出。",
    "<strong>Influence.</strong> Contribute to the discussions that shape Kenya-China tea trade, investment and technology.": "<strong>影响力。</strong>参与塑造肯尼亚-中国茶叶贸易、投资和技术的讨论。",
    "<strong>Relationship-building.</strong> Build direct relationships through the programme and the planned B2B matchmaking service.": "<strong>关系建立。</strong>通过峰会议程和计划中的B2B配对服务建立直接业务关系。",
